    "dialog": {
      "converse": {
        "default": {
          "default": [
            "It looks like I've have plenty of snacks for my research here.",
            "Even if I wasn't a scientist, I can see how dense in calories the food here is.",
            "If I'm not careful I could be packing away quite a lot of weight from all these high calorie treats.",
			"I've heard interesting stories of odd, strangely fat themed, things happening across the universe lately.",
			"Good thinking doesn't come from an empty stomach!",
			"Calorium sounds like an interesting thing to study. An organic fat-derived FTL fuel? How fascinating!",
			"One of my colleagues was studying some fatty tissue they found in the outer fringes. Wonder how he's doing right now?"
          ]
        },
        "floran": {
          "default": [
            "Floran is resssearcher! Sstopping by for lunch.",
            "Floran wants to ssstudy new Calorium fluid. Fuel from fatss? Interesssting!",
